Name Rio Note - Misc #2 Letter from Abroad

Interactability_Text_Line_0 My beloved Barbara,
Interactability_Text_Line_1 I know you were expecting me to be back home in time for our wedding anniversary, but things have taken a turn for the worse here in Portugal. In retrospect, I shouldn't have gone on this business trip. I mean, barely anyone showed up due to sickness.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 As you might have heard, the Portuguese authorities have decided to restrict international travel the day before I was supposed to fly back to Brazil. I'm currently weighing my options, but I do promise to be back by May for your mother's birthday.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 By then, I hope you stay safe,
Interactability_Text_Line_4 João Diaz